== env passes an assignment to the command:
hello
== env runs a shell builtin with the assignment applied:
done
== the assignment does not leak past the command:
[unset]
== an unresolved command fails with status 127:
status=127
== env isolates builtin directory changes:
status=0 unchanged=yes
== env isolates builtin variable changes:
status=0 state=parent
== env confines exit and returns its status:
alive status=7
